  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Chefs have very clear opinions on what their favorite methods are. Some may be avid brewers. Some may prefer pastry. Others may be fairly lazy and prepare huge masses of comfort food that keep for a week. At 1st level, the gourmend chooses two culinary skillsets from those listed in Section: Culinary Skillsets. Each skillset grants a number of abilities at the levels indicated in its entry.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/gourmend#toc5\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
